INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(7069,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11075666','A Call for a Transformative Public Health Training: The Necessity of Abolition.','Lipo Zovic H, Riley T, Sandon Perez-Bill E, Dsouza N, Mitchell C.','2023','interrogates resists supremacy carceral abolitionist uprising sanctioned murders floyd breonna tony mcdade imprisonment supremacy carceral complicity resists phcrp injustices airhihenbuwa hardeman karbeah phcrp airhihenbuwa phcrp abolitionist carceral capitalism supremacy subjugating capitalism slavery genocide interrogated laster pirtle capitalism woven slave patrols squashed uprisings enslaved reichel slave patrols militia hassett glimpse constructions reproducing classism supremacy ratification fourteenth enslaved crow legalized hassett enforcers statesanctioned tripling tonry sentencing staggering surveilled gelman hyland remster jahn punitive deivanayagam nonviolent offenses carceral disenfranchisement criminalized jahn criminalization complicity carceral wacquant criminalization kajeepeta carceral noncarceral carceral jahn begs fairchild perpetuates healthism criminalization breilh sociopolitical homosexuals hemophiliacs haitians criminalization homosexuality alang blackstock testament atheoretical petteway sociopolitical entrapping disembodied carceral abolitionist dismantling envisioning kaba abolishing abolishing murakawa champine equips abolitionist abolitionist resisting oppressive panther potorti lords rican activist abolitionist undo dually optation appropriated erasure depoliticization harvest hooks abolitionist airhihenbuwa sociopolitical capitalism laster pirtle interrogating criminalization fullilove nowotny asmerom echoing kaba kaba abolitionist geographies abolitionist studentled abolitionist cops fullilove spade carceral illuminated decarceration jails redirected unlearning relearning authentically unlearning relearning airhihenbuwa kaba carceral conspire disposability carceral presupposes othered disposabilit